        L_1q=nothing,
    )

    - id::Int64 : Unique integer identifier for this component
    - R::Float64 : Resistance after EMF
    - R_f::Float64 : Field motor winding resistance
    - R_1d::Float64 : Damping rotor winding resistance on d-axis, denoted as RD in Machowski
    - R_1q::Float64 : Damping rotor winding resistance on q-axis, denoted as RQ in Machowski
    - L_d::Float64 : Inductance of fictitious damping that represent the effect of the three-phase stator winding in the d-axis of the rotor, in per unit. This value is denoted as Lad + Ll in Kundur (and Ld in Machowski)
    - L_q::Float64 : Inductance of fictitious damping that represent the effect of the three-phase stator winding in the q-axis of the rotor, in per unit. This value is denoted as Laq + Ll in Kundur
    - L_ad::Float64 : Mutual inductance between stator winding and rotor field (and damping) winding inductance on d-axis
    - L_aq::Float64 : Mutual inductance between stator winding and rotor damping winding inductance on q-axi
    - L_f1d::Float64 : Mutual inductance between rotor field winding and rotor damping winding inductance on d-axis
    - L_ff::Float64 : Field rotor winding inductance
    - L_1d::Float64 : Inductance of the d-axis rotor damping circuit
    - L_1q::Float64 : Inductance of the q-axis rotor damping circuit
